        Header Span Tables: How to Size Door &amp; Window Headers (IRC Table R602.7)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        When cutting rough openings in load-bearing walls, structural headers transfer roof and floor gravity loads around the opening to the foundation. Here is how to size headers correctly and avoid sagging doors.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Interactive Tool Callout -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl mb-8 shadow-xs flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
